<section id="couple-section" class="bg-white relative w-full min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center z-1 !px-6 !py-16 sm:!px-10">

    <div class="bg-dotted-pattern-edges min-h-screen h-full w-full absolute pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative w-full max-w-6xl">
        
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-10 lg:flex-row lg:gap-x-[6vw]">

            <!-- Photo Carousel -->
            <PhotoCardCarousel Imgs="@(Imgs)" />

            <!-- Text -->
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 max-w-xl px-2">
                <p class="page-title" style="font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 41px) !important;">And so, our story begins</p>

                <p class="!text-black text-center text-sm sm:text-base font-[300]">
                    It all started with a simple chat on Facebook, way back in college. Just a casual “hi,” with Matthew consistently chatting and replying to my stories every other day. One day, I finally replied with a “thank you” GIF. <br /> <br /> Neither of us thought much of it at first—but that one message turned into daily conversations, silly jokes, and, slowly, something deeper. <br /> <br /> What began as a small online connection grew into something real, filled with shared food trips, study sessions, and moments we’ll never forget. <br /> <br /> We’ve been through ups and downs, long distances, and life changes, but somehow, we always found our way back to each other. <br /> <br /> And now, after all those years and memories, we’re finally here—ready to start our forever.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

